cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NemaCom: nematode community analysis, faunal indices and soil health scoring"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Ashish Kumar
    affiliation: "Division of Nematology, ICAR-Indian Agricultural Research Institute, New Delhi"
version: 0.3.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open tool that computes Norton (1978) community descriptors, diversity
  indices, Bongers/Ferris maturity and food-web indices, Andrassy/Ferris
  metabolic footprints, and the Ghaderi et al. (2025) Nematode Soil Health
  index from a single spreadsheet of nematode counts.
